^{:go/end 323} (go/func canMergeLoadClobber "canMergeLoadClobber reports whether the load can be merged into target without\ninvalidating the schedule.\nIt also checks that the other non-load argument x is something we\nare ok with clobbering.\n" ^bool [^{:tag (* Value)} target ^{:tag (* Value)} load ^{:tag (* Value)} x]
  ;; The register containing x is going to get clobbered.
  ;; Don't merge if we still need the value of x.
  ;; We don't have liveness information here, but we can
  ;; approximate x dying with:
  ;;  1) target is x's only use.
  ;;  2) target is not in a deeper loop than x.
